  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>600</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NO</mi></math> are mixed with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>NO</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8644;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>The reaction occurring as above comes to equilibrium under a total pressure of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;atm. Analysis of the system shows that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></math> of oxygen are present at equilibrium. The equilibrium constant for the reaction is____.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>NO</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>NO</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>Total number of moles=<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>According to Dalton&#39;s law,</p><p>Partial pressure<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math>Total pressure<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo></math>Mole fraction</p><p>Mole fraction<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Number</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>moles</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>one</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>component</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>Total</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>number</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>moles</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mrow><msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>NO</mi></msub><mo>.</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>=<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>664</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>864</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8824</mn><mo>&#8771;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></blockquote>",
